(## 1. Entry Point Architecture) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The front-end entry begins in `frontend/index.html`, where Vite serves the HTML shell and) Tj
T*
(injects the browser entry module `/src/main.jsx`. That file imports `StrictMode` from React,) Tj
T*
(`createRoot` from `react-dom/client`, global styles from `index.css`, and the root component) Tj
T*
(from `App.jsx`. It mounts the app into the `#root` DOM node with) Tj
T*
(`createRoot\(...\).render\(...\)`, so Vite is responsible for serving the module graph in) Tj
T*
(development while React takes over rendering once the page loads.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`frontend/src/App.jsx` is the application root component. It owns the major UI sections,) Tj
T*
(initializes page state, fetches catalog data from the backend, derives category data for) Tj
T*
(display, and renders the storefront shell. In practice, `main.jsx` is the bootstrapping) Tj
T*
(entry and `App.jsx` is the functional entry for the product experience.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The back-end entry is `backend/index.js`. Express initializes by importing `express` and) Tj
T*
(`cors`, creating the app with `express\(\)`, assigning the port from `process.env.PORT ||) Tj
T*
(5174`, and registering middleware with `app.use\(cors\(\)\)` and `app.use\(express.json\(\)\)`. It) Tj
T*
(defines an in-memory product catalog, exposes `GET /api/products`, and starts the server) Tj
T*
(with `app.listen\(PORT, ...\)`. That route is the main catalog endpoint consumed by the React) Tj
T*
(app.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(## 2. Data Flow & API Contract) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The data flow starts in `frontend/src/App.jsx` inside a `useEffect` hook that runs on) Tj
T*
(initial render. The component calls `fetch\("http://localhost:5174/api/products"\)`, waits for) Tj
T*
(the response, checks `res.ok`, then parses JSON with `res.json\(\)`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The backend route in `backend/index.js` handles `GET /api/products`. It reads from the local) Tj
T*
(`products` array and annotates each item before returning it. The server-side annotations) Tj
T*
(include:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `priceFormatted`, generated with `Intl.NumberFormat\("en-IN", { style: "currency",) Tj
T*
(  currency: product.currency }\)`) Tj
T*
(- preserved delivery text from each product's `delivery` field) Tj
T*
(- preserved merchandising metadata such as `badge`, `category`, and `description`) Tj
T*
(- a top-level `banner` string returned alongside the curated product list) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
