(## 3. Layer Separation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The dependency boundary is cleanly split between rendering concerns in the frontend and API) Tj
T*
(concerns in the backend.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`frontend/package.json` contains rendering and developer-experience packages:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `react` and `react-dom`: component rendering and DOM mounting) Tj
T*
(- `vite`: dev server, module graph, and production build pipeline) Tj
T*
(- `@vitejs/plugin-react`: React support in Vite) Tj
T*
